  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transport for Strengthening Livestock Marketing in Turkana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Livestock.Beneficiaries: Livestock Marketing Associations of 9 counties in rural Kenya.The project funds will be used to purchase a truck and develop a Transportation Management Plan to govern their new transport business. The Livestock Marketing Associations of Kakuma; Oropoi; Loima; Kalokol; Kerio; Lokori; Katilu; Kaputir and Kainukwill benefit from access to regular and reliable transportation services to move their livestock to markets.</narrative>
  </description>
